{"detail": {"templateUuid": "068ea26ea6e54ed581d05b83e908609e", "projectUuid": "1d276a4dc48e43449c42d9b301fc128f", "name": "《山海访事录》之《不妒》｜原创东方寓言动画", "description": "《山海访事录》是一部以《山海经·五藏山经》异兽记载为起点，由AME原创开发的东方寓言动画系列。\n我们借采风官夷坚的视角，重新走近那些只存在于古籍寥寥数语中的神物，也记录神兽背后耐人寻味的人间真情。\n第一篇《不妒》，写的是夫妻相处之道，也是我们对“食者不妒”这四个字的一次重新想象。\n《山海经·南山经》记载：\n“有兽焉，其状如狸而有髦，其名曰类……食者不妒。”\n朝廷采风官夷坚来到亶爰山，追寻异兽“类”的踪迹，也因此走进了染布村一对夫妻的生活。\n嫉妒会伤害爱。\n可如果一个人彻底不再嫉妒，连占有、牵挂与等待都一并消失，夫妻之间剩下的又是什么？\n《山海访事录》系列将持续更新。\n下一篇，继续随夷坚入山访异。", "coverUrl": "/assets/bba0cdbaa48769ed.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/e475dfaf6e0a472f99fb3c4d65f06b14/9c91e0084defbbc73f60ae1bca7356c4106805d5.mp4", "snapshotId": 42335, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5734303, "ownerUuid": "e475dfaf6e0a472f99fb3c4d65f06b14", "avatar": "/assets/bb438065ac59fdb7.webp", "nickname": "AME", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 88, "tags": [{"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3060, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3. 盗梦空间", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3060", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://xhslink.cn/o/3hWvTZ4juIC", "createAt": "2026年08月31日 17:03", "updateAt": "2026年09月04日 11:55", "publishAt": "2026年08月31日 17:03", "playCount": 356, "viewCreationProcessCount": 141, "copyCanvasCount": 32, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/068ea26ea6e54ed581d05b83e908609e.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 259, "edges": 3